  - [1mNo UI, API only[0m — ship [38;5;153mgetPreference[39m/[38;5;153msetPreference[39m and the theme application, with no control. Persistence would be
    real but untestable by hand.

  [1mMy recommendation: the inline control.[0m It's the only option that doesn't invent navigation, and it makes the
  persistence visible — reload the page and the choice survives, which is the whole point of the request.
